{"id":6737970321,"name":"Livetopia 🏡 RP","desc":"══ 10/16 UPDATE 248 ══\n 👭👫 Welcome LEGO® Friends to the game! Join an adventure with them!\n🔑 Search for the key pieces to unlock the Friendship Tree House Hangout.\n🌈 Step through the rainbow portal for more fun in the LEGO Friends world.\n🦄 Visit the Unicorn Café, soak up the vibes and give the LEGO Friends a hand.\n🧁📸🎵🎂 Challenge yourself with four fun mini-games!\n\n══ IT'S YOUR W🌎RLD ══\n🎭 RP! Choose your own roles, outfits, and jobs to roleplay!\n🏡 Own houses and vehicles in the city! Boating and flying!\n🐱 Hangout with other people and unique pets!\n🧐 Explore and find secrets in the city and towns!\n\n══ L❤️VETOPIA ══\nPlease thumbs-up 👍 and favorite ⭐ if you enjoy the game.\n\nGenres: Roleplay, RP, Town & City, Hangout, Explore.","path":"/game/6737970321-livetopia-rp","slug":"6737970321-livetopia-rp","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/421a89825c320326c195a8e93cf5a960642218852e5728acca5cf58f91fad963.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-01704a71bcd956f9fb6b541c4ed5f5ff/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":2942,"visitor":5507582659,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-10-18T12:59:13.993Z","creator":{"name":"Century Makers","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":14,"freeCount":14,"keyCount":7,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"6ad47e20873bc8193ba447ae","title":"AYUSH SPAMMER","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c78122","gameId":6737970321,"name":"Livetopia 🏡 RP","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"slug":"6737970321-livetopia-rp","path":"/game/6737970321-livetopia-rp","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":6737970321},"slug":"Livetopia-RP-AYUSH-SPAMMER-232230","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":882,"executes":54,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/5b70875798a7531dccbe5c908451e2d49e8d4136294cd6a68360ffa7f338248a.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/6737970321-1792310816218.jpg","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/6737970321-1792310816218.jpg"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/5b70875798a7531dccbe5c908451e2d49e8d4136294cd6a68360ffa7f338248a.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/6737970321-1792310816218.jpg","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/6737970321-1792310816218.jpg"},"likeCount":0,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-10-18T08:06:56.449Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-18T08:06:56.449Z","lastBump":"2026-10-18T08:06:56.449Z","script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tapashazra2345-netizen/AYUSH-SPAMMER/refs/heads/main/SCRIPT\"))()","features":"👑 AYUSH SPAMMER ⚡🥶👑\n\nA lightweight, all-in-one chat spammer GUI with\nmessage editing, multi-target support, and RX\nChat loader integration. No key system.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n✦ HOW IT WORKS\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nThe script creates a draggable on-screen panel\nwith the following controls:\n\n🎯 TARGET     — Who the message is directed at\n✏️ SYMBOL     — Character used as prefix (default @)\n🔢 COUNT      — Number of symbols per message\n⏱️ SPEED      — Delay between messages (seconds)\n\nWhen START is pressed, the loop takes each\nmessage from the list, prepends the symbol\nrepeated N times, wraps the target name in\nbrackets, and sends it through the active\nchat system (TextChatService or legacy).\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n✦ FEATURES\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n✅ Drag-able GUI with minimize button\n✅ 18 preloaded messages (fully editable)\n✅ Message Editor — add / edit / delete / save\n✅ Auto-saving to ayush_messages.json\n✅ MULTI TARGET panel — 10 slots (5×2 grid)\n✅ Auto-detects filled slots → enables MULTI\n✅ Cycles through only filled targets\n✅ Compatible with TextChatService & legacy chat\n✅ One-click RX Chat loader integration\n✅ No key system / no external dependencies\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n✦ MULTI TARGET SYSTEM\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nOpen the MULTI panel → type up to 10 target\nnames in the slots. Any filled slot auto-\nenables MULTI mode, and the spam loop cycles\nthrough only the filled targets. Blank slots\nare ignored. The Target box locks while MULTI\nis active. Click \"CLEAR ALL\" to reset.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n✦ MESSAGE EDITOR\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nClick 📝 EDIT to open the editor.\n  ➕ ADD  — adds a new blank message row\n  ✕       — deletes that row\n  💾 SAVE — writes everything to the JSON\n            file and closes the editor\nMessages persist between sessions via\nwritefile/readfile (executor required).\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n✦ RX CHAT BUTTON\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nClicking 💬 RX CHAT fetches the RX Chat script\nfrom its GitHub source, loads it, and executes\nit in the same environment. Status shows\nsuccess or failure. No permanent modification\nis made to your files.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n✦ REQUIREMENTS\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n• Executor with loadstring + writefile/readfile\n• Roblox client (any game with chat enabled)\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n⚠️ USE RESPONSIBLY — chat spam can get you\nmuted or kicked in some games. Use at your\nown risk. For educational/personal use only.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nPOWERED BY SUMIT ⚡","tags":[],"discord":"","keyLink":"https://keygenerator88.netlify.app/","owner":{"_id":"6abd9a6d5a463e3b0fe0b7a6","username":"shersumit9","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"lvl":4,"status":"offline","id":"6abd9a6d5a463e3b0fe0b7a6","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-